    {"id":"T01","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":20,"when":{"traffic":"easy"},"advice":"通行しやすい環境です。参加者の移動を止めない運用を意識すると、スムーズに案内できます。","facts_used":["traffic"],"behavior_tags":["FALLBACK_SINGLE"]},
    {"id":"T02","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":20,"when":{"traffic":"easy"},"advice":"人が移動しやすい場所です。複数のPOIへ案内する回遊型の運用とも相性があります。","facts_used":["traffic"],"behavior_tags":["FALLBACK_SINGLE"]},
    {"id":"T03","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":20,"when":{"traffic":"easy"},"advice":"通行空間に余裕があります。集合場所と移動ルートを分けると、さらに動きやすくなります。","facts_used":["traffic"],"behavior_tags":["FALLBACK_SINGLE"]},
    {"id":"T04","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":20,"when":{"traffic":"easy"},"advice":"参加者を次のポイントへ誘導しやすい環境です。滞留よりも流れを作る運用を意識してみましょう。","facts_used":["traffic"],"behavior_tags":["FALLBACK_SINGLE"]},
    {"id":"T05","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":20,"when":{"traffic":"easy"},"advice":"移動しやすさを活かして、参加者が自然に巡れる案内方法を考えてみましょう。","facts_used":["traffic"],"behavior_tags":["FALLBACK_SINGLE"]},
    {"id":"T06","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":20,"when":{"traffic":"easy"},"advice":"通行しやすい場所でも、集合時に一か所へ人が集中しすぎないよう配置を意識すると安心です。","facts_used":["traffic"],"behavior_tags":["FALLBACK_SINGLE"]},
    {"id":"T07","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":20,"when":{"traffic":"narrow"},"advice":"一部に狭い場所があります。立ち止まる位置は通路を避けて設定しましょう。","facts_used":["traffic"],"behavior_tags":["FALLBACK_SINGLE"]},
    {"id":"T08","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":20,"when":{"traffic":"narrow"},"advice":"狭い区間では参加者を長く留めず、通過するポイントとして使うと運用しやすくなります。","facts_used":["traffic"],"behavior_tags":["FALLBACK_SINGLE"]},
    {"id":"T09","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":20,"when":{"traffic":"narrow"},"advice":"人が重なると通行しにくくなる場所があります。集合地点は幅のある場所を選びましょう。","facts_used":["traffic"],"behavior_tags":["FALLBACK_SINGLE"]},
    {"id":"T10","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":20,"when":{"traffic":"narrow"},"advice":"狭い場所の前後で人が止まらないよう、案内する位置を少しずらすのも有効です。","facts_used":["traffic"],"behavior_tags":["FALLBACK_SINGLE"]},
    {"id":"T11","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":20,"when":{"traffic":"narrow"},"advice":"通路幅が限られる場所では、参加者が自然に流れる方向を意識して案内しましょう。","facts_used":["traffic"],"behavior_tags":["FALLBACK_SINGLE"]},
