    {"id":"T14","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":20,"when":{"traffic":"careful"},"advice":"人が集まる位置を慎重に決めたい場所です。通路上での長時間滞在は避けましょう。","facts_used":["traffic"],"behavior_tags":["FALLBACK_SINGLE"]},
    {"id":"T15","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":20,"when":{"traffic":"careful"},"advice":"通行する人を優先できるよう、参加者の待機位置をあらかじめ考えておくと安心です。","facts_used":["traffic"],"behavior_tags":["FALLBACK_SINGLE"]},
